WEBVTT

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:18.100
Honoka, Shizuku...

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.010
Good morning.

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:20.310
Morning.

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:21.930
Good morning, Ms. Shiba!

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:25.190
Uh, I mean...

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:26.650
Miyuki!

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:28.230
You look really cheerful.

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:29.900
Did something good happen?

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:32.570
Actually, this morning, my brother--

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:35.530
It was a given that I'd be picked
for the Disciplinary Committee,

00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:39.200
but what an eyesore that Course 2 guy is!

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.160
A Course 2 student having authority
over us Course 1s?

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:44.160
That's way beyond disrespect!

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:47.880
You said it!
He'd better not get in our way!

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:50.000
That loser Weed!

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.300
Wh-What's going on?

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:02.100
This is a warning.

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:06.270
Calling Course 2 students "Weeds"
and otherwise reviling them in my presence

00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:10.610
isn't something I can overlook
as a member of the Student Council.

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:14.190
So, please take care from now on.

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:16.110
Am I making myself clear?

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:19.030
C-C-Crystal clear!

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:02.390
Hello, freshmen!

00:03:02.390 --> 00:03:05.430
Why don't you join us
sweet-looking club members for a fun time?

00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:07.520
Join the tennis team!

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.640
Well, it's started again this year.

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:13.150
All the frenzy of freshmen rushing...

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:15.270
Right, since it's the first big moment

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:18.690
for both the Student Council
and the Disciplinary Committee.

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:20.240
We need to stay on our toes.

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:20.860
"STUDENT COUNCIL OFFICE"

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:22.490
"STUDENT COUNCIL OFFICE"

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:22.490
Oh, but really...

00:03:22.490 --> 00:03:24.830
I'm always so swamped
at this time of year...

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:26.450
I think my head is spinning!

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:27.330
Hey!

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:27.620
"EASY! GREAT BENTO RECIPES"

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:30.210
"EASY! GREAT BENTO RECIPES"

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:30.210
What is that exactly?

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:31.830
"EASY! GREAT BENTO RECIPES"

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:31.830
Oh, come on!

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:36.500
I was the only one stuck with the dining hall's
menu for lunch today, and it was sad!

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:38.800
All right, I hear you, but do that at home.

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:42.260
You're setting a bad example
for our new recruit, Shiba.

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:45.100
It's okay. I'm used to it by now.

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:48.220
You see that? It's totally acceptable!

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:51.640
That's not the issue here, okay?

00:03:53.730 --> 00:04:00.150
So, our biggest priority
is student safety, right?

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:03.240
Students are normally barred
from carrying CADs,

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:06.660
but it's allowed during this rush period
for demo purposes.

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:09.080
It's more or less
free-for-all out there now.

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:12.540
Well, the school wants
as many people to join clubs

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:14.540
so we can do better in
the Nine Schools Competition.

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:18.710
So, they look the other way
on moderate rule violations.

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:22.170
That's where we,
the Disciplinary Committee, come in.

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:22.880
"DISCIPLINARY COMMITTEE"

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:28.010
"DISCIPLINARY COMMITTEE"

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:28.010
If we see any violence or rule-breaking
involving magic, we intervene on the spot...

00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:30.680
and make arrests if necessary.

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:34.850
You can be sure that I'll be running
your brother into the ground.

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:38.190
I am positive that my brother
will be useful to you.

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:42.690
Uh, yeah. I didn't mean
to bring up your brother like that.

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:48.530
Although I can't say I'm not looking forward
to seeing how he deals with it.

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:52.500
It must be so hard for the freshmen.

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:55.580
Their entrance exam scores
are being secretly circulated,

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:58.090
so everyone's going hard
after the top students...

00:04:58.090 --> 00:05:02.510
not to mention there'll be vicious wrangling
over the ones who've competed before.

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:04.930
Secretly circulating?

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:06.840
But isn't that a problem?

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:11.890
Well, that's how crucial our showing in
the Nine Schools Competition is to the academy.

00:05:11.890 --> 00:05:14.060
We're not in a position to intervene.

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:15.230
I see.

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:19.940
I know they'll be after you in particular.
Not that I'll let them have you.

00:05:19.940 --> 00:05:22.030
Uh, right.

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:25.950
If the top students are being targeted,
then that means...

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:26.660
"CALLIGRAPHY
CLUB MEMBERS WANTED"

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:27.530
"CALLIGRAPHY
CLUB MEMBERS WANTED"

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:27.530
Have you decided which club
you're going to join, Shizuku?

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:29.280
"KENDO CLUB"

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:29.280
Have you decided which club
you're going to join, Shizuku?

00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:30.490
Not yet.

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:34.200
But I'd like to join one that could get me
picked for the Nine Schools Competition team.

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:38.750
That's your dream, huh, Shizuku?

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:42.800
Then, how about the SS Board Biathlon team or...

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:46.260
Honoka Mitsui... Shizuku Kitayama!

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:47.260
It's definitely them!

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:49.090
Those two!

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:53.140
--They're both top-tier phenoms!
--They're joining our club, no matter what!

00:05:54.730 --> 00:05:56.560
Wanna join the Shooting Club?

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:59.440
--Any interest in gymnastics?
--Why don't you start playing handball?

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:03.530
Don't push, please.

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:05.780
--Don't pull!
--I can't take this, Shizuku!

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:08.860
This is no time to be deciding on a club!
Let's make a run for it!

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:11.330
I agree, but we can't.

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:14.200
--Outta my way!
--No, you move! You wanna fight?

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:29.720
Sorry to address you from my horse.

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:32.930
Trying to drag students
into your clubs against their will...

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:35.430
Don't you think you're being heavy-handed?

00:06:35.430 --> 00:06:37.730
Wh-What did you say?

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:42.560
Act like a gentleman
when you're inviting a lady. Understand...

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:44.570
Upperclassman?

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:45.730
Now then...

00:06:45.730 --> 00:06:46.990
let's go!

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:52.820
Hang on tight now!

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:56.450
I'm going to fall!

00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:00.000
Are you two okay?

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.500
Oh, yes.

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:03.090
U-Um...

00:07:03.090 --> 00:07:05.300
Thanks for saving us.

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:09.680
Don't mention it!
Not like I can talk, either.

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:13.800
I used even more brute force to
take you away than those upperclassmen!

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:20.310
I'm Eimi Akechi of Class 1-B.

00:07:20.310 --> 00:07:24.060
My full name
is Amelia Eimi Akechi Goldie.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:26.820
Just call me "Eimi," okay?

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:29.950
I'm Honoka Mitsui of Class 1-A.

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:32.280
Ditto. Shizuku Kitayama.

00:07:33.490 --> 00:07:36.540
Nice to meet you, Honoka and Shizuku!

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:42.250
Wh-What's that?

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:44.130
What's going on?

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:46.460
What is this?

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:48.090
Could those be...

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:50.300
Psionic waves?

00:07:54.090 --> 00:07:57.180
What the... My activation sequence!

00:07:57.180 --> 00:07:59.850
Why? Why isn't our magic working?

00:07:59.850 --> 00:08:01.770
I feel sick!

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:06.060
I'll be taking you in,

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:09.610
Mr. Kirihara, for the improper use of magic.

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:11.570
Did that Disciplinary Committee member...

00:08:11.570 --> 00:08:14.070
use Cast Jamming?

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:20.250
A magician who can neutralize magic
without the rare metal Antinite?

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:22.410
I want you to dig deeper into him.

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:25.790
Tatsuya Shiba.

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:31.840
"WOMEN'S LOCKER ROOM A"

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:33.340
What do we have next?

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:34.760
I know!

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:36.140
What a hassle!

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:37.850
It was so hard, don't you think?

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:38.810
It was really hard!

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:41.180
I'm so sweaty!

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:42.850
I'm so tired!

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:44.770
By the way,
I've decided which club to join!

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:46.560
Huh?

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:49.150
So, Miyuki, do you have
another Student Council meeting tod--

00:08:59.990 --> 00:09:01.790
--That's way too stimulating!

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:04.670
--Dazzling.
--That's way too stimulating!

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:07.210
Excuse me! Oh, there you are!

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:10.500
Honoka! Shizuku!

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:12.420
E-Eimi?

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:14.380
What's going on?

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:16.640
I found out what that was yesterday.

00:09:16.640 --> 00:09:21.350
Seems like the kenjutsu team was brawling
with magic in the dojo!

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:23.770
That's why there were Psionic waves.

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:24.600
But listen!

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:30.190
I hear that a single Disciplinary Committee
member took them all out by himself!

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:32.440
With his bare hands no less!

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:36.700
Do you think that could've been--

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:38.620
Yes, it was my brother!

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:40.870
He told me about it yesterday.

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:44.750
--I knew it!
--What? He's your brother?

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:46.000
That's amazing!

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:50.540
Amazing! I mean, First High's Kenjutsu Club
is one of the best in the country,

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:53.460
and that Kirihara guy's
like the stud of the team!

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:55.760
Your brother's too amazing to be true!

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:57.220
Oh, please...

00:09:57.220 --> 00:10:02.890
Well, with all the talent my brother has,
of course he should be able to do that.

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:07.020
That's so awesome!
Your brother has my respect!

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:12.770
Wow! There's a whole horde
of them again today!

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:18.660
I'm sure they'll be after you two again,
so try to get home safely with Eimi.

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:19.870
Okay!

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:23.910
All right, what should we do?

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:27.290
I guess it comes down
to what route we can take to get home.

00:10:27.290 --> 00:10:28.540
Hey!

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:31.840
Don't you guys have any stealth spells?

00:10:31.840 --> 00:10:33.170
"Stealth"?

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:36.340
Are you talking about Onmyodo
or Ancient Magic?

00:10:36.340 --> 00:10:38.220
Stealth is stealth!

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:39.970
As in undercover agent.

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:43.890
Like Matsudaira Izunokami
or the Kishu Oniwaban.

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:45.100
Haven't you heard of them?

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:46.430
Oh!

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:48.940
You mean the class of
Ancient Magic called "Ninjutsu"?

00:10:48.940 --> 00:10:51.100
Well, not that it's just about Ninjutsu.

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:55.360
I mean the spells that divert attention
or let you conceal yourself!

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:58.110
I can't wield them, but Honoka's an expert.

00:10:58.110 --> 00:10:58.900
Oh?

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:02.320
But wouldn't it be against the rules
to use magic without permission?

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:05.700
Oh, it's a little late for that now!
Normally, we'd have to abide by the rules,

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:08.120
but there's magic
flying around everywhere now!

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:13.290
Well, you do have a point,
but I just messed up big time the other day.

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:14.960
I see what you mean, Eimi.

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:16.760
That does make sense.

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:20.680
Honoka, it's fine,
since you're not attacking this time.

00:11:20.680 --> 00:11:23.600
Not that I was attacking
that day, either, okay?

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:27.560
"WELCOME"

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:32.860
Got to give you props, Honoka!

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:34.440
Easy-peasy!

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:38.570
Shush! Keep your voices down,
or we'll get busted!

00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:41.910
Sorry about that!

00:11:41.910 --> 00:11:43.070
Now I'm pissed!

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:45.280
--Yeah? Bring it!
--You two there!

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:46.870
Tatsuya?

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:48.200
He's on the Disciplinary Committee?

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:50.330
He's Miyuki's big brother.

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:52.460
What? That's him?

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:55.090
Take your hands off each other, please.

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:15.520
Air Bullet!

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:19.860
Shizuku...

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:20.820
Was that...

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:22.450
He was being targeted.

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:24.450
--No question about it.
--What?

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:27.280
Targeted? You mean Miyuki's big brother?

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:28.450
Yes.

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:31.910
Tatsuya...

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:33.330
Wait...

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:39.380
Pardon me.

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:42.510
Brother!

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:44.010
Thank you for your hard work.

00:12:44.010 --> 00:12:45.050
Yeah.

00:12:45.050 --> 00:12:47.260
You, too, Miyuki. Good work.

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:51.390
What's wrong?

00:12:51.390 --> 00:12:55.190
Brother, please answer me honestly.

00:12:55.190 --> 00:12:57.980
You were subjected
to a magic attack, weren't you?

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:01.650
I wasn't subjected to one.

00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:05.160
But you're not denying
that you were targeted by one?

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:08.700
The fact is, you're right about that.

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:11.160
How did you know?

00:13:11.160 --> 00:13:13.370
A sister's intuition.

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:15.790
Is that something
you can tell with intuition?

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:18.540
I think it's more
like a woman's intuition.

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:20.500
A-A woman's?

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:24.590
Are you really sure you're not hurt?

00:13:24.590 --> 00:13:28.600
If anything were to happen
to you, Brother, I would--

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:31.560
Miyuki...

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:34.480
There's nothing to worry about.

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:40.480
I'm not so weak that I can be wounded
by cowards who resort to sneak attacks.

00:13:40.480 --> 00:13:43.650
That's absolutely true, but...

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:48.410
I wish you'd confide in me more.

00:13:48.410 --> 00:13:51.240
Needless to say,
I'm not going to just let this go.

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:55.250
As soon as I find out who it is,
I'll let you know, too.

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:58.420
Please promise me that you will, Brother.

00:13:58.420 --> 00:14:02.170
"If you break that promise,
I'll have to punish you, Brother."

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:03.840
"You don't have to remind me, Miyuki."

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:04.670
Oh!

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:06.380
What beautiful sibling love!

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:09.970
"Your punishment
will be a tickling, Brother."

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:12.930
Why would anyone target Tatsuya?

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:14.730
I don't see a motive.

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:16.270
But who knew?

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:19.190
He's a Course 2 student, huh?

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:24.650
Dodging an Air Bullet coming at him from behind
without even turning around... So cool!

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:27.700
I can see he's Miyuki's brother, all right!

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:32.910
Um, doesn't it bother you at all
that Tatsuya's a Course 2 student, Eimi?

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:35.370
Bother me? Why would it?

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:38.330
Could there be a more ridiculous custom?

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:40.380
Blooms and Weeds and all that?

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:44.090
Stereotyping people based
on a single test score is so stupid!

00:14:44.090 --> 00:14:48.550
I mean, we're all First High students, right?

00:14:48.550 --> 00:14:52.010
A first year Course 2 student
on the Disciplinary Committee...

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:55.180
On top of that, he's powerful,
and his looks...

00:14:55.180 --> 00:14:56.310
aren't bad.

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:58.190
E-Eimi!

00:14:58.190 --> 00:14:59.480
Huh?

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:00.560
I got it!

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:03.110
Someone jealous of him was behind this crime!

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:04.480
What?

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:08.320
Someone who resents him for being so amazing
was like, "The nerve of him! Get rid of him!"

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:11.110
Something like that?
Doesn't that sound like a likely scenario?

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:14.370
Launching a surprise attack
out of jealousy is beyond cowardly!

00:15:14.370 --> 00:15:15.370
It's unforgivable!

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:16.750
It's incomprehensible.

00:15:16.750 --> 00:15:20.460
We can't let such an injustice
go unpunished!

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:23.790
But Honoka, what are we
actually going to do?

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:26.670
Um, report it to the Student Council...

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:28.300
But we don't have any proof.

00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:33.300
Also, if we tell the Student Council,
of course Miyuki will hear about it, too.

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:35.140
--Oh!
--Huh?

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:39.600
If she finds out Tatsuya was attacked,
who knows what she'll do?

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:42.730
Look what she did just because
someone bad-mouthed him!

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:44.900
Can you imagine
what'll become of this culprit?

00:15:44.900 --> 00:15:48.650
Huh? You mean Miyuki's that terrifying?

00:15:48.650 --> 00:15:53.370
How can we protect Tatsuya
without Miyuki finding out?

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:55.700
In that case, there's just one way!

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:58.250
All we have to do
is resolve this ourselves!

00:15:58.250 --> 00:15:59.120
What?

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:00.290
What do you mean?

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:05.840
If we can catch the culprit before Miyuki
finds out, the case will be closed, right?

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:06.800
Um...

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:09.420
By "we," do you mean us three?

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:11.180
That's right!

00:16:11.180 --> 00:16:15.800
You, me, and Shizuku...
Girls' Detective Club is going to mobilize!

00:16:15.800 --> 00:16:17.010
Huh?

00:16:17.010 --> 00:16:18.850
A school mystery!

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:21.350
That's always been my dream!

00:16:21.350 --> 00:16:23.270
I just know she's enjoying this.

00:16:24.610 --> 00:16:29.110
So, you weren't able to see him
actually use that pseudo-jamming thing?

00:16:29.110 --> 00:16:30.740
Forgive me.

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:35.240
I was sure that if we caught him off guard,
he would activate it.

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:39.950
I see that we'll never find out for sure
unless you do it yourself.

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:41.160
Can I count on you?

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:42.580
Yes.

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:45.920
If we can manage to get him to join us,
it will be icing on the cake.

00:16:45.920 --> 00:16:46.750
Right.

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:49.800
That task should go to Sayaka Mibu.

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:52.720
Why don't we have her take care of it?

00:16:59.470 --> 00:17:01.730
If we keep an eye on Miyuki's brother

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:05.650
and get photos of him being attacked,
we'll have our proof!

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:07.900
I wonder where Tatsuya is.

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:09.070
Found him.

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:10.650
He's on the boulevard by the lab building.

00:17:10.650 --> 00:17:11.740
Huh?

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:13.450
Oh! Tatsuya!

00:17:13.450 --> 00:17:15.240
You know what...

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:17.320
we're acting like stalkers.

00:17:17.320 --> 00:17:19.410
Huh? N-N-No we're not!

00:17:19.410 --> 00:17:23.160
We're detectives!
No way are we stalkers!

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:24.330
Huh?

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:29.380
Signs of a Psionic wave?

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:35.760
What? It vanished?

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:38.140
Was that Cast Jamming?

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:40.470
--No question.
--Yeah.

00:17:40.470 --> 00:17:45.310
But it didn't look like Miyuki's brother
was using Antinite.

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:48.020
That's true.

00:17:48.020 --> 00:17:50.110
There he is! The attacker!

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:52.320
Under the tree to the right!

00:17:57.200 --> 00:17:59.030
It's no good. Won't get there in time.

00:17:59.030 --> 00:18:00.950
Eimi! Photos! Photos!

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:03.540
Oh no, I forgot!

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:05.210
Did you get it?

00:18:05.210 --> 00:18:06.870
Who knows?

00:18:15.590 --> 00:18:17.090
This is...

00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:25.850
Is that the report from
the Extracurricular Activities Federation?

00:18:25.850 --> 00:18:30.060
Y-Yes. It's about that incident
at the dojo the other day.

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:32.820
What's wrong?
You look so despondent.

00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:35.070
Is there something bothering you?

00:18:35.070 --> 00:18:37.610
I don't know if I'd call it "bothering me."

00:18:37.610 --> 00:18:39.110
Kirihara...

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:43.450
You're saying that you sensed Mibu's sword
changing into something it shouldn't?

00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:45.330
That's what you sensed?

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:49.750
Yes. It was turning into something
oddly bloodthirsty. A sword for killing others.

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:57.340
Someone on the kendo team must've corrupted
her sword! When that thought hit me...

00:18:57.340 --> 00:19:00.430
I just couldn't stand by and say nothing.

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:04.560
If what Mr. Kirihara said is true...

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:08.020
There's someone
corrupting Ms. Mibu's sword.

00:19:08.020 --> 00:19:09.980
Somewhere here in First High.

00:19:09.980 --> 00:19:14.270
First, the incident at the dojo,
then the attack on my brother...

00:19:14.270 --> 00:19:18.030
What is happening at this academy now?

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:23.410
Brother...

00:19:23.410 --> 00:19:26.410
Has anything out of the ordinary
happened since then?

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:28.870
No, nothing of note.

00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:32.420
By the way, Miyuki...

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:37.130
Your classmates, Mitsui and Kitayama...

00:19:37.130 --> 00:19:40.590
Would you mind telling me
a little about those two?

00:19:41.890 --> 00:19:45.680
My brother is interested in other girls!

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:46.720
Miyuki?

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:49.480
Wh-What about Honoka and Shizuku?

00:19:49.480 --> 00:19:51.980
They're just ordinary girls, right?

00:19:51.980 --> 00:19:53.310
Without any abnormal tendencies--

00:19:53.310 --> 00:19:54.690
T-Tendencies?

00:19:54.690 --> 00:19:58.240
What I mean is,
can they take sensible action?

00:19:58.240 --> 00:20:01.410
I-I don't think
there's anything to worry about.

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:02.700
Don't tell me!

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:05.780
Those two haven't caused you
some kind of trouble, have they?

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:07.790
It's not like that at all.

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:10.580
Calm down.

00:20:15.840 --> 00:20:20.260
It seemed like they were observing me
from afar while I was on patrol,

00:20:20.260 --> 00:20:22.180
so I was wondering
what they were after.

00:20:22.180 --> 00:20:24.430
Those two were doing that?

00:20:24.430 --> 00:20:28.220
Along with another girl
with bright red hair.

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:30.600
I think she's from Class 1-B.

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:32.770
That's Eimi Akechi.

00:20:32.770 --> 00:20:35.560
Are those three just watching you?

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:36.860
Hmm...

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:38.780
They seem to be taking pictures.

00:20:38.780 --> 00:20:39.860
Pictures?

00:20:39.860 --> 00:20:41.490
Of you, Brother?

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:42.610
I'm so jeal--

00:20:42.610 --> 00:20:44.570
No, no, how vulgar of me!

00:20:44.570 --> 00:20:46.200
B-But...

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:47.780
I want some!

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:48.870
No.

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:51.080
They're not photos of me.

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:54.960
It seems like they're targeting
the one who's been messing with me.

00:20:54.960 --> 00:20:56.670
Is that true?

00:20:56.670 --> 00:20:59.670
Someone's still harassing you, Brother?

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:17.650
I'm so sorry.

00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:19.190
Don't worry about it.

00:21:19.190 --> 00:21:22.740
So anyway, it's not like
I've suffered any actual harm,

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:26.410
but I was wondering
what their game plan is.

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:31.830
I just hope that the people coming after me
will be satisfied with high school-level spite.

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:35.210
But if that's not the case,
then it wouldn't do to get too involved.

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:38.630
No, I'm overthinking it, aren't I?

00:21:38.630 --> 00:21:41.550
Honoka, Shizuku, Eimi...

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:45.300
What on earth are you trying to accomplish?

00:21:45.300 --> 00:21:46.470
Check this out!

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:47.300
Huh?

00:21:47.300 --> 00:21:49.760
The attacker from yesterday! It's him!

00:21:49.760 --> 00:21:51.010
No question about it!

00:21:51.010 --> 00:21:52.220
Right.

00:21:52.220 --> 00:21:55.020
Class 3-F, Kinoe Tsukasa.

00:21:55.020 --> 00:21:57.060
The captain of the boys' kendo team.

00:21:57.060 --> 00:21:59.360
This is the guy who attacked Tatsuya?

00:21:59.360 --> 00:22:02.360
--Let's do it! For Miyuki's sake, too!
--Right!

00:22:02.360 --> 00:22:05.400
The three of us are going to catch him,
no matter what!

00:22:05.400 --> 00:22:06.740
Right.

00:22:06.740 --> 00:22:07.570
Eimi!

00:22:07.570 --> 00:22:08.410
Honoka!

00:22:08.410 --> 00:22:09.620
Huh?

00:22:11.910 --> 00:22:14.790
Girls' Detective Club... Let's go!

00:22:14.790 --> 00:22:16.620
Right!
